Below are the two required edits to add support for ignoring origins the page already hints to via `<link rel="preconnect">` or `<link rel="dns-prefetch">`.  

1) Add `LinkElements` to the audit’s `requiredArtifacts` so that the audit can see your `<link>` tags.  
2) In the audit implementation, build a `Set` of origins from any `<link rel="preconnect">` or `<link rel="dns-prefetch">` and then skip those origins in the network-record filtering.

